  "open_questions": [
    "1. 'Nuts' in Appendix C lists only tree nuts (almond, cashew, pistachio, walnut, praline, marzipan). Peanut, hazelnut, pecan and coconut are not listed. Is peanut covered by 'nuts'? Peanut is a common serious allergen, so a decision from the supervisors is needed before dish data is entered.",
    "2. FR-ALG-11 requires Urdu names for each allergen and its hidden names, but Appendix C Table C.1 has none. Draft Urdu names (name_ur, synonyms_ur) were added here and must be verified by a native speaker before dishes go live (SRS 4.2: both language versions verified). Appendix C should be updated with the verified names.",
    "3. The example ingredients in Appendix C (milk, butter, paneer, egg, flour) are direct ingredients, not hidden names. Recommend the rules file (S1-KF-04 and S2-KF-08) matches them too, so that a dish listing 'paneer' is flagged as dairy.",
    "4. Appendix C says its examples are indicative and must be checked against the final dish ingredient data. Re-check this file when the 20 dishes are entered."
  ]
